msgid "Warp lane mask (defaults to ``0xFFFFFFFF``, i.e. all 32 lanes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:629
msgid "Non-zero if any thread in the mask has a non-zero predicate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:637
msgid ""
"Lowers to ``__all_sync(mask, predicate)`` on CUDA and ``__all(predicate)`` "
"on HIP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:643
msgid "Non-zero if all threads in the mask have a non-zero predicate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:651
msgid ""
"CUDA: ``__ballot_sync(mask, predicate)`` returns ``unsigned int``; codegen "
"zero-extends it to ``uint64`` (upper 32 bits always zero for 32-wide warps). "
"HIP: ``__ballot(predicate)`` returns ``uint64`` natively, covering all 64 "
"wavefront lanes. The mask argument is ignored on HIP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:656
#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:665
msgid "Bitmask with bit N set if lane N's predicate is non-zero."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:662
msgid ""
"Full-warp / full-wavefront ballot. Equivalent to ``ballot_sync(predicate)`` "
"(i.e. with the default full warp mask)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:673
msgid ""
"Lowers to ``__activemask()`` (zero-extended to ``uint64``) on CUDA and "
"``__ballot(1)`` on HIP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:679
msgid ""
"Block barrier that returns the number of threads whose ``predicate`` "
"evaluates to non-zero (``__syncthreads_count`` on CUDA and HIP)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:685
msgid ""
"Block barrier that returns non-zero only if ALL threads have a non-zero "
"``predicate`` (``__syncthreads_and`` on CUDA and HIP)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:691
msgid ""
"Block barrier that returns non-zero if ANY thread has a non-zero "
"``predicate`` (``__syncthreads_or`` on CUDA and HIP)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:697
msgid ""
"Return a ``uint32`` bitmask of lanes in ``mask`` whose ``value`` equals the "
"calling lane's value. Lowers to ``__match_any_sync`` on CUDA (compute "
"capability >= 7.0). Not supported on HIP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/builtin/index.rst:706
msgid ""
"Lowers to ``__match_all_sync`` on CUDA (compute capability >= 7.0); the "
"trailing ``int*`` predicate output is hidden in codegen and discarded. "
"Callers can reconstruct the predicate as ``result != 0``. Not supported on "
"HIP."
msgstr ""

